1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:04,000
Makam pahlawan Perang Troya diduga
ditemukan di pantai Turki...

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:04,815
konon,

3
00:00:04,815 --> 00:00:06,231
ia raksasa!

4
00:00:06,231 --> 00:00:06,954
Ajax,

5
00:00:06,954 --> 00:00:08,370
terkuat setelah Achilles...

6
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,611
namanya dipakai klub Ajax Amsterdam!

7
00:00:10,611 --> 00:00:13,213
Bukit itu dulu dikira desa purba.

8
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:14,620
Ombak mengikisnya,

9
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,565
lalu digali:

10
00:00:15,565 --> 00:00:17,676
ternyata gundukan buatan manusia,

11
00:00:17,676 --> 00:00:19,231
dekat lokasi catatan kuno!

12
00:00:19,231 --> 00:00:20,963
Penulis kuno bercerita:

13
00:00:20,963 --> 00:00:22,954
laut membongkar makam Ajax...

14
00:00:22,954 --> 00:00:24,991
kerangkanya setinggi 5 meter!

15
00:00:24,991 --> 00:00:25,935
Ahli menduga:

16
00:00:25,935 --> 00:00:27,259
fosil gajah purba!

17
00:00:27,259 --> 00:00:27,769
Follow,

18
00:00:27,769 --> 00:00:29,972
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
